{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5502719084e4cd5a","name":"Investigation","source":{"id":"source:reference-5502719084e4cd5a","title":"Investigation","revision":21198,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:20:26Z","sha256":"74fa543b7cdf9fa4919dee65873aca858f0528601c087bc5b6c429409d1bd080","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21198","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Investigation&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5502719084e4cd5a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},", the heroes are trying to uncover information about a particular person, object, or organization. For the purposes of this challenge, the heroes are covertly investigating their target in an urban environment, and they must discover what they need without attracting the notice of the enemy.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Investigation Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Complexity:"]}," 2 (8 Successes before 3 Failures)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested Primary Skills for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," (DC 26):"]}," The heroes can attempt to trick someone who has knowledge about their target- such as a close friend or a person working on a relevant project- into revealing the information that they seek."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," (DC 16):"]}," The heroes can gather rumors in local cantinas in an attempt to piece together the information they need."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)"}," (DC 16):"]}," The heroes can try to recall bits of related information that they learned in the past, applying it to the current situation to assemble a more complete picture of their target."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," (DC 21):"]}," The heroes can attempt to slice into planetary networks to retrieve secret information, learning what they can from the databanks of secure computers."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Challenge Effects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Challenge Effects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Challenge_Effects"}," for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Close Call"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Close_Call","referenceId":"reference:06e10d30642aaca6"},":"]}," The heroes accrue Failures only on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," that fail by 5 or more."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Degrees of Success"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Degrees_of_Success","referenceId":"reference:5059731ee2f0416b"},":"]}," For every two Successes the heroes earn, they learn a new piece of information about their target."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Success and Failure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Success:"]}," The heroes learn everything they need to know about their target.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Failure:"]}," The heroes fail to learn everything they need. Worse, their enemies become aware that the heroes are present and seeking information.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
